{
  "name": "CF-04 Interview Scheduler",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CF-04 · Interview Scheduler (sub-workflow / agent tool)\n`action: list_slots | book` for ONE application.\n\n• **Ownership is checked in SQL**: a candidate can only see/book slots for their own *shortlisted* application.\n• Booking uses row locks (`SELECT … FOR UPDATE`) → no double booking.\n• Google Calendar + Gmail run *after* the booking is saved; if Google fails the booking still stands (nodes continue on error).\n• The result returned to the AI agent contains **no candidate e-mail** (data minimisation).",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 820,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "60626ee6-ecf3-4769-bb31-9707fb706fe1",
      "name": "Sticky Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -400
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "workflowInputs": {
          "values": [
            {
              "name": "action",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "application_id",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "name": "slot_id",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "name": "actor_id",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "name": "actor_role",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "ed399779-c121-464b-9534-0db3c9a6d0c5",
      "name": "When Called by Another Workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
