        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "=<p>Hello {{ $('Book Slot (atomic)').first().json.result.candidate.first_name }},</p><p>Your interview for <b>{{ $('Book Slot (atomic)').first().json.result.job_title }}</b> ({{ $('Book Slot (atomic)').first().json.result.app_code }}) is booked for <b>{{ $('Book Slot (atomic)').first().json.result.interview.when }}</b>.</p><p>Mode: {{ $('Book Slot (atomic)').first().json.result.interview.mode }} — {{ $('Book Slot (atomic)').first().json.result.interview.location }}{{ $json.hangoutLink ? '<br>Google Meet: ' + $json.hangoutLink : '' }}</p><p>Good luck!<br>CompanyFlow Talent Team</p>",
